title: "concept-regrounding: few-shot re-grounding of a concept abstraction under a fixed rule"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Pigazzini
    given-names: Pasquale
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-6977-7317"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.0.1
date-released: 2026-10-27
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23686213
identifiers:
  - type: doi
